<p>
Lord Jesus, Teacher of the moral life,<br />
grant me wisdom to teach the truth with clarity,<br />
and charity to apply it with mercy.<br />
Help those entrusted to me to act with integrity,<br />
choosing what is good, intending what is right,<br />
living each moment for Your glory.<br />
Amen.
</p>
</blockquote>

